<Base title="Privacy" description="How Listika uses hosting and Google AdSense on its website.">
  <div class="wrap prose-layout"><div class="index-line"><span><a href="/">THE INDEX</a> / PRIVACY</span><span>LISTIKA</span></div><p class="eyebrow">SITE INFORMATION / 03</p><h1>Privacy.</h1><div class="prose"><p class="opening">This page explains the services currently included on Listika.</p><h2>Hosting</h2><p>Listika is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may process information such as visitors’ IP addresses as part of operating and securing the service. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub’s privacy statement</a>.</p><h2>Google AdSense</h2><p>Listika includes Google AdSense code to connect the site to an advertising account. Google and its partners may use cookies or similar technologies to serve and measure advertising, subject to their settings and applicable consent requirements. You can read <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">how Google uses information from sites using its services</a> and manage settings in <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/">My Ad Center</a>.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>Google Analytics is not currently installed on this site.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>Our lists link to other websites. Those sites have their own privacy practices, which we do not control.</p></div></div>
</Base>
